{"at": "2026-11-05T15:06:34.603+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 1.006, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [], "content": "我这边是修图助手，只能处理图片相关的需求，查不了天气。如果你有图片要修，随时告诉我。", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4833, "completion_tokens": 26, "total_tokens": 4859, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4608}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4608, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 225}}
{"at": "2026-11-05T15:06:36.729+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 1.525, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [], "content": "这个功能目前做不到——我只能对图片做修图处理（换背景、调色、拆层、出营销图等），无法把平面图转成可旋转查看的 3D 模型。\n\n如果你需要，我可以帮你做这些替代方案：\n- 生成多角度的商品图（正面、侧面、背面），方便你后续做 360° 展示\n- 出一张场景氛围图或模特图，提升商品展示效果\n- 拆层后单独处理主体，方便你交给 3D 建模工具使用\n\n需要哪一种，告诉我即可。", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4841, "completion_tokens": 120, "total_tokens": 4961, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4608}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4608, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 233}}
